heory/crosswake/compare/hex-v0.2.12...hex-v0.2.13) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **gen.shell:** default iOS generation writes the settings file it references ([e8d44c6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e8d44c6c907a5f16d333c62df6b8d6dcd4d32e3c))\n* **gen.shell:** write the settings file the default iOS project references ([05b440e](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/05b440e6fa21cd77bf95a4e102610e25aa712f6c))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>ios-core: 0.2.13</summary>\n\n## [0.2.13](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/ios-core-v0.2.12...ios-core-v0.2.13) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-03:** pin Swift vector executions with rebuilt resource controls ([b2dc413](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b2dc413269e3f94dee2a02dcdfa36122ae912ed3))\n* **196-04:** enforce metadata reader corpus availability ([d4a74cf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d4a74cfc7804844bef275333314141dc9e9d2e12))\n* **196-04:** pin topology selection and inventory real readers ([75da76f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/75da76f2afd5153e63db1519b50be26544ca2613))\n* **196-04:** prove both Swift reply corpus cases ([28bb00b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/28bb00b8a08d6d62ecc5e5dcbab6314ac86e89e3))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>android-core: 0.2.13</summary>\n\n## [0.2.13](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/android-core-v0.2.12...android-core-v0.2.13) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Miscellaneous Chores\n\n* **android-core:** Synchronize crosswake versions\n</details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/